Package: tilling
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Pedro Nieva <321570081+luas-graphicss@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libegl1, libgbm1, libinput10, libseat1, libudev1, libxkbcommon0
Recommends: foot, libwayland-client0, libwayland-egl1
Homepage: https://github.com/luas-graphicss/Tilling-Window-Manager
Description: Tiling Wayland compositor
 Tilling arranges the windows of each workspace as tiles, with BSP,
 master-stack and monocle layouts, and is driven from the keyboard.
 It runs on DRM/KMS from a virtual terminal or as a window inside
 another Wayland session, and tillingctl controls it over a local socket.
